BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Elul Book Talk: The Correspondent
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260903T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260903T203000
UID:tribe-2190@nertamid.org
DESCRIPTION:Grab our Elul Beach Read – The CorrespondentFor the fifth ye
 ar in a row\, we are excited to recommend our newest “Elul Beach Read\,
 ” The Correspondent by Virginia Evans. The book is a 2025 epistolary nov
 el about a 73-year-old retired lawyer\, Sybil Van Antwerp\, who communicat
 es through letters and emails\, and exploring themes of grief\, regret\, a
 nd forgiveness as she confronts a painful past. It’s the perfect opening
  to explore our own inner work we will do in anticipation of the High Holy
  Days.Plea
URL:https://nertamid.org/event/elul-book-talk-the-correspondent/
X-SOURCE:Temple Ner Tamid
END:VEVENT
